Kind: widen
Issue: #723
Holds open: the driver of -P's test on an application processor -- startup moves start_kernel_threads() to the first application processor running before it calls preempt_test_run_remote(), where the scheduler had it at times, and says where it stands. At two processors that one is the only processor the test may choose.
Accel: tcg,kvm
Run: --entry 5 300 -smp 2

